      "content": "wait but the er is so expensive and i really dont want to take him in that late at night if it's just a stomach bug. he's still breathing okay, he just seems really out of it. if i give him some Pedialyte or even just juice, won't that fix the dehydration issue? can't i just monitor him at home for another few hours to see if he perks up?",
